{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-数据报表与分析\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"获取橙子建站和程序化落地页的数据，不包含第三方落地页，披露橙子建站落地页用户行为关键指标分日数据，落地页数据以当日前两天的方式返回。需配合【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token。\",\"id\":\"ad.report.site.page.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/report/site/page/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710565390348\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要通过该接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"ad.return_code.reference\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"用于查询接口返回码和返回信息的说明\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"},{\"id\":\"ad.site_report_metrics.reference\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710760171535#custom-anchor-建站报表落地页指标名称\",\"reason\":\"用于查询接口应答中指标名称的说明\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"建站报表落地页指标名称\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710565390348\",\"title\":\"橙子建站落地页数据\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\" data-listener-added_fb028dbb=\"true\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1U0nTwZ0\">获取橙子建站和程序化落地页的数据。不包含第三方落地页。</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-5oXaIo3A\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9pYwQV7r\">该接口披露橙子建站落地页用户行为关键指标<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">分日数据</code>，包括： <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">页面访问量</code>:PV <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">用户访问量</code>:UV <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">转化率</code>:单元convert数/单元click事件 <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">平均加载时长</code>:页面平均加载渲染时长 <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">平均阅读比例</code>:用户平均浏览落地页的比例 <code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">平均访问时长</code>:平均在落地页的停留时长</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-CigWLVVY\">落地页数据以当日前两天的方式返回，如：当3号入参查询周期1天，返回1号数据</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201772283331155975%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-kjmktM7y\" id=\"h6f20189-kjmktM7y\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-PfT8abUG\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/report/site/page/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/report/site/page/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710565390348\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-rKd6AM3w\" id=\"h6f20189-rKd6AM3w\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-jehPijxJ\">GET</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-mhw7DWl8\" id=\"h6f20189-mhw7DWl8\">请求Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-E1E4s4T0\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-XPpMxHwj\"><col data-id=\"c3dce10