p838747a-0GETg5jy\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-4bc7zn1s\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-O0q1KeJR\">站点ID</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-1sxZfVlo\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-LKNbczX2\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ag5tpOAc\">time_duration <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ypqai%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-o3vDMKhP\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-45kTLoAz\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-HWWxFYyW\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qZvCQ7De\">查询时间周期。<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">DAY</code>:1天。<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">THREE_DAY</code>: 3天。<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">WEEK</code>:7天。<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">MONTH</code>:30天。</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-qc1GytRe\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-rQUdWVRj\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GLvAacS4\">inventory_type</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-atHt9FTy\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-w3gQMuqV\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb871063-J0TpFJdH\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-i1PZ00V8\">首选投放位置。不传默认查全部。<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">WATERMELON</code>:西瓜。<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">HOTSOON</code>:火山。<br/><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">AWEME</code>:抖音。<br/><code sty